:semiotic_projection_1 rdf:type :SemioticProjection ;
                rdfs:label "User projected onto the conversational scene as the recipient of the theological warning"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'conversational_scene' and the textual entity 'top_text'. The scene depicts one woman earnestly speaking to another, which visually frames the user as the potential recipient of the extreme theological message. The text 'if you don't believe in god you're going to suffer...' directly addresses the user with a conditional statement, creating a direct projection of the user as the target of the warning. The user is implicitly 'you' in the statement, making them the subject of the threat."@en ;
